Now, without further ado, here are the potential new rewards for Combat Achievements:

===Easy Tier Rewards===
* Earn '''100%''' more Warrior Tokens from the Warriors' Guild.
* Gain an '''additional point''' per successful game of Pest Control.

===Medium Tier Rewards===
Although these first two are upgraded versions of the Easy Tier rewards, please note that they do not stack with the Easy version:
* Earn '''200%''' more Warrior Tokens from the Warriors' Guild.
* Gain an additional '''2 points''' per successful game of Pest Control.

An additional Medium Tier reward is:
* The total number of Cannonballs a Cannon can hold is '''increased to 35''' (+5 more than it's base).
* You will '''no longer''' be affected by the Prayer Drain effect at Barrows while Ghommal's Hilt is equipped.

===Hard Tier Rewards===
We're bumping the benefits from one of the Medium bonuses – again, this does not stack:
* Gain an additional '''3 points''' per successful game of Pest Control.
* The total number of Cannonballs a Cannon can hold is '''increased to 45''' (+15 more than it's base).

And we've got one new reward coming to the Hard Tier:
* Imbuing items at either Nightmare Zone or Soul Wars will be '''50% cheaper'''.

===Elite Tier Rewards===
* The total number of Cannonballs a Cannon can hold is '''increased to 60''' (+30 more than it's base).
* Superior Slayer Monsters will have a '''1/150 chance''' to spawn - a 25% higher chance than the standard rate of 1/200.
* Expeditious Bracelets and Slaughter Bracelets will now have a '''10% chance''' to fully recharge instead of breaking.

===Master Tier Rewards===
* Summoned Thralls now last '''50% longer'''.
* You'll receive a new Blessing that, when worn, gives charged items (Scythe of Vitur, Trident of the Seas, etc.) a '''5% chance''' to not consume charges.
* The Avernic Defender can now be combined with Ghommal's Hilt 5 for a swanky new cosmetic upgrade!
* NPC Contact becomes '''4 cycles''' faster to cast.

===Grandmaster Tier Rewards===
* Summoned Thralls now last '''100% longer'''.
* Casting 'NPC Contact' will now be a total of '''7 cycles faster'''.
* The Avernic Defender can now be combined with the Ghommal's Hilt 6 for an even swankier cosmetic upgrade!

